    "updated_at": "2021-12-17T19:16:10Z",
    "body": ">  they don't control behaviors that are specific to particular language bindings.\r\n\r\nThey actually can, though not in obvious ways.  For example, in some JITs they inform things like common subexpression elimination behavior.",
